 ```
 
+### Time Format Compound
+
+```ts
+ms(5400000, { compound: true })        // "1h 30m"
+ms(90061000, { compound: true })       // "1d 1h 1m 1s"
+ms(-5400000, { compound: true })       // "-1h 30m"
+```
+
+Largest unit first, zero parts are skipped, and units go from days down to
+seconds (leftover milliseconds are dropped). Ignored when `long` is `true`.
+
 ### Input Formats (Units)
 
 ```ts
